1. Identify the public entry points in the changed files from the diff.
2. For each, derive input domains from its declared parameter types: text (empty, unicode, very long, control characters), numbers (zero, negative, non-finite, extreme magnitude, fractional), collections (empty, single, very large, nested), structured values (missing fields, unexpected fields, self-referencing), and enumerated types (every variant, plus a value outside the set).
